# Binary formats must never go through Git's CRLF conversion. The seed PDF
# in particular is pure ASCII with no NUL bytes, so Git's content heuristic
# treats it as text and rewrites its line endings — which shifts every byte
# offset in the PDF's xref table and silently corrupts the file.
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
